1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
No script. It's already rolling.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,210
I just look into the lens and talk.

3
00:00:12,167 --> 00:00:14,457
Do you want to say something?

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,500
I don't know what to say.

5
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:25,373
It's pretty good, right?

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:28,170
What do you mean, "pretty good"?

7
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:37,563
Like friends.

8
00:00:37,563 --> 00:00:41,183
Friends, what kind of friends?

9
00:00:45,967 --> 00:00:54,567
Friends with benefits.

10
00:00:54,567 --> 00:00:55,947
Are you happy then?

11
00:00:56,257 --> 00:00:58,357
Pretty happy.

12
00:00:58,367 --> 00:00:59,467
You sleep with them, too?

13
00:00:59,633 --> 00:01:07,983
Yes. Right.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:18,770
It can feel easy.

15
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:23,560
Are you unhappy with me?

16
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:25,220
I am happy.

17
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:26,570
You didn't say that.

18
00:01:27,167 --> 00:01:28,400
I'm happy.

19
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,560
But you just didn't say,

20
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,150
You said you felt at ease.

21
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,090
You just saw me.

22
00:01:34,333 --> 00:01:36,223
Feeling at ease matters more than being happy.

23
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,720
Are you comforting me?

24
00:01:42,733 --> 00:01:47,113
No.

25
00:01:47,943 --> 00:01:49,323
Maybe I want to.

26
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:55,830
But do I need that kind of comfort from you?

27
00:01:55,830 --> 00:01:56,890
You're strange.

28
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:03,070
I don't want anything to affect our
relationship.

29
00:02:05,067 --> 00:02:08,677
It already has.

30
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:13,030
Didn't you say it was fine?

31
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:19,750
What did I say?

32
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:22,750
You think it will affect our relationship?

33
00:02:24,333 --> 00:02:28,153
Maybe before,

34
00:02:28,153 --> 00:02:35,513
Hmm, maybe I didn't think so much before.

35
00:02:36,873 --> 00:02:39,883
But I recently found that,

36
00:02:39,883 --> 00:02:41,303
It really is affecting us.

37
00:02:44,613 --> 00:02:54,563
Whenever they come to see me at night,

38
00:02:54,563 --> 00:02:59,023
I can tell it's affecting something.

39
00:03:01,267 --> 00:03:05,097
I thought, I thought this would make you
happy,

40
00:03:05,097 --> 00:03:07,957
At the beginning, weren't we...

41
00:03:07,967 --> 00:03:15,117
It felt good at first,

42
00:03:15,897 --> 00:03:22,567
But now something has changed.

43
00:03:23,427 --> 00:03:27,087
Well... some things...

44
00:03:27,087 --> 00:03:33,377
have changed. What has affected all this?

45
00:03:37,337 --> 00:03:46,897
It affects it.

46
00:03:49,347 --> 00:03:53,577
Maybe we were too optimistic at first.

47
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:58,920
So should I cut ties with them?

48
00:03:59,867 --> 00:04:02,800
I don't know, I just

49
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,350
Hmm.

50
00:04:07,333 --> 00:04:10,353
And what about you two?

51
00:04:11,553 --> 00:04:13,873
I get jealous sometimes, too,

52
00:04:13,873 --> 00:04:15,603
But I think that needs to be overcome.

53
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,870
I don't want to ruin your relationship,

54
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:22,630
I think these are all good things.

55
00:04:26,867 --> 00:04:30,917
But now it doesn't feel so good,

56
00:04:30,917 --> 00:04:31,667
It's changed.

57
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:34,600
It's changed?

58
00:04:35,467 --> 00:04:38,927
No, I mean... the relationship has changed,
too.

59
00:04:40,033 --> 00:04:41,763
What do you think?

60
00:04:42,333 --> 00:04:43,893
Did you have expectations for it?

61
00:04:43,900 --> 00:04:44,833
Yes?

62
00:04:44,833 --> 00:04:46,893
No, I didn't have any expectations for it,

63
00:04:46,893 --> 00:04:49,693
It's all become so strange,

64
00:04:49,693 --> 00:04:50,553
You know?

65
00:04:54,367 --> 00:04:58,507
All of this has become very strange,

66
00:04:58,507 --> 00:05:01,467
I'm starting to feel a little uncomfortable.

67
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:05,240
Are you afraid we'll break up?

68
00:05:07,433 --> 00:05:10,233
I guess so,

69
00:05:10,233 --> 00:05:12,663
I guess that's it.

70
00:05:13,913 --> 00:05:17,033
But I feel like it's not that fragile,

71
00:05:17,033 --> 00:05:23,633
It's just, um, this thing shouldn't be that
fragile.

72
00:05:23,633 --> 00:05:24,983
No?

73
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,630
What do you think?

74
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:32,400
What do you think?

75
00:05:32,670 --> 00:05:35,660
Do you also feel that many things have
changed?

76
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:41,430
Are the hard parts something to overcome?

77
00:05:43,533 --> 00:05:46,833
But I can't overcome it now!

78
00:05:46,833 --> 00:05:50,203
I can't overcome it.

79
00:05:50,553 --> 00:05:56,353
How to overcome it?

80
00:05:56,367 --> 00:06:00,987
I once bought a kitten with them,

81
00:06:00,987 --> 00:06:02,968
and buried it here.

82
00:06:04,507 --> 00:06:06,500
Did I tell you?

83
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:08,560
You did. I don't remember.

84
00:06:09,167 --> 00:06:11,167
It should be doing well now, right?

85
00:06:15,877 --> 00:06:19,507
I don't know why I have to overcome these
things.

86
00:06:21,047 --> 00:06:22,107
It's strange.

87
00:06:22,107 --> 00:06:22,717
Why?

88
00:06:23,117 --> 00:06:27,137
Why did it turn out like this?

89
00:06:27,137 --> 00:06:29,367
Messy?

90
00:06:29,367 --> 00:06:31,087
Do you want to end it?

91
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:34,150
So do you think you can enjoy all this?

92
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,190
Do you enjoy it?

93
00:06:36,230 --> 00:06:38,790
Why do you always ask me if I want to end it?

94
00:06:39,667 --> 00:06:41,037
I don't feel bad.

95
00:06:41,057 --> 00:06:43,167
Are you happy? Are you enjoying this?

96
00:06:45,733 --> 00:06:47,013
There's more happiness.

97
00:06:50,273 --> 00:06:51,853
It's okay, I can listen to you.

98
00:06:52,233 --> 00:06:53,073
If you want,

99
00:06:53,073 --> 00:06:54,563
Why am I always the one talking?

100
00:06:57,273 --> 00:06:59,513
Why am I always the one who has to talk?

101
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:03,900
Can't you say something?

102
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:07,480
I think we could pause for a while if you're
unhappy.

103
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,540
So that's what you wanted to tell me.

104
00:07:11,540 --> 00:07:12,860
To pause for a while.

105
00:07:12,867 --> 00:07:15,137
I think we can pause.

106
00:07:15,947 --> 00:07:17,687
If this is making you unhappy,

107
00:07:17,687 --> 00:07:18,947
I think we can pause.

108
00:07:22,733 --> 00:07:26,533
I thought we'd find a way together,

109
00:07:26,533 --> 00:07:28,613
to get through this.

110
00:07:28,613 --> 00:07:41,803
But you said you wanted to stop.

111
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:48,060
And you just stand there with that damn
camera, watching me.

112
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:49,680
You think that camera is you?

113
00:07:51,380 --> 00:07:53,860
Huh? Why are you watching me through it?

114
00:07:53,867 --> 00:07:57,627
I don't know what to do.

115
00:07:57,627 --> 00:07:59,527
I never thought it'd be like this.

116
00:08:01,333 --> 00:08:07,463
A way. A way. A way.

117
00:08:08,667 --> 00:08:12,387
What I want to say is,

118
00:08:12,387 --> 00:08:14,007
You can pause and think.

119
00:08:14,007 --> 00:08:17,747
But you need an answer right now.

120
00:08:17,747 --> 00:08:19,377
And I don't have one.

121
00:08:22,367 --> 00:08:30,633
I don't know what makes you uncomfortable!

122
00:08:30,633 --> 00:08:40,553
Everything makes me feel uncomfortable.

123
00:08:40,553 --> 00:08:42,833
I feel like I'm suffocating.

124
00:08:44,833 --> 00:08:48,633
Say something!

125
00:08:49,093 --> 00:08:51,133
Why won't you say anything?

126
00:08:51,133 --> 00:08:55,467
Say something!

127
00:08:55,467 --> 00:09:00,967
Is the sun bothering you?

128
00:09:02,133 --> 00:09:08,453
Do you want to go somewhere without cameras?

129
00:09:08,603 --> 00:09:11,367
Okay, then.

130
00:09:11,367 --> 00:09:13,567
Aren't you going to ask me anything?

131
00:09:14,433 --> 00:09:16,273
No. I think it's nice not to talk.

132
00:09:17,667 --> 00:09:18,837
You want to talk?

133
00:09:20,833 --> 00:09:26,863
I do feel a little uncomfortable,

134
00:09:26,863 --> 00:09:27,343
But...

135
00:09:27,343 --> 00:09:30,743
I don't want you two to end things, either.

136
00:09:30,743 --> 00:09:32,633
I think those are all good things.

137
00:09:34,233 --> 00:09:38,353
It's good as it is now.

138
00:09:38,353 --> 00:09:40,823
Very comfortable, very happy.

139
00:09:53,723 --> 00:09:55,863
It's good to just sit here like this.

140
00:10:13,287 --> 00:10:14,337
We are different.

